    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="container">
        <a href="/home" class="brand">
          <img class="brand-mark" src="/images/posh-passage-logo.png" alt="">
          <span class="brand-word">Posh Passage<span>LIMOUSINES</span></span>
        </a>
        <nav class="nav-primary">
          <a href="/home">Home</a>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
          <a href="/service">Services</a>
          <a href="/fleet">Fleet</a>
          <a href="/book">Book a Ride</a>
          <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
          <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="header-actions">
          <a href="tel:+16723773932" class="call-chip">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path
                d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z" />
            </svg>
            (672) 377-3932
          </a>
          <a href="/book" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Book a Ride</a>
          <button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false"><span></span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>

      <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="container">
          <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
          <h1>Limousine &amp; Party Bus<br>Questions, Answered.</h1>
          <p class="lede">Everything we get asked most often. Can't find it here? Just call us.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section-tight">
        <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
          <div class="faq-list">

            <details class="faq-item" open>
              <summary>What areas do you serve?<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                    stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                  </svg></span></summary>
              <p>We run across Metro Vancouver, the Fraser Valley (including Chilliwack), USA Seattle Airport and the
                Sea-to-Sky corridor up
                to Squamish and Whistler. If you're just outside that range, call us — we can often still make it work.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>How far in advance should I book?<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                    stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                  </svg></span></summary>
              <p>As soon as your date is set is always safest — for weddings, proms and other high-season dates we'd
                suggest a few weeks out if you can. That said, we'll always do what we can for last-minute requests, so
                don't hesitate to call even if your date is close.</p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>How is pricing determined?<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                    stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                  </svg></span></summary>
              <p>Pricing depends on distance, hours booked, vehicle type and date. Send us a request or give us a call
                and we'll put together a straightforward, no-obligation quote.</p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>Do you require a deposit?<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                    stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                  </svg></span></summary>
              <p>Deposit requirements can vary depending on the event and season. We'll always walk you through exactly
                what's needed before you commit to anything.</p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>What's your cancellation policy?<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                    stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                  </svg></span></summary>
              <p>Cancellation terms are confirmed at the time of booking so there are no surprises later — just ask when
                you reserve and we'll spell it out clearly.</p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>Is gratuity included?<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"
                    stroke-linecap="round">
                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                  </svg></span></summary>
              <p>Not automatically — we'll always be upfront about what is and isn't included on your quote before you
                book.</p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>What's the difference between the limousine and the party bus?<span class="chev"><svg
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                  </svg></span></summary>
              <p>The stretch limousine seats around 8–10 and suits quieter, more formal occasions — weddings, proms,
                airport arrivals. The party bus seats 20–30+ with LED lighting and a bigger sound system, built for
                groups who want the night to start on the way there.</p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>Do you provide car seats?<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                    stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                  </svg></span></summary>
              <p>Let us know when you book and we'll do our best to accommodate — just give us a heads-up in advance so
                we can have it ready.</p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>Can you pick us up from YVR or Abbotsford Airport?<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                  </svg></span></summary>
              <p>Yes — airport transfers are one of our most requested services. We track your flight and adjust pickup
                timing automatically if it's delayed.</p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>Is alcohol allowed onboard?<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                    stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                  </svg></span></summary>
              <p>This depends on the event, vehicle and local regulations. Reach out when you book and we'll walk you
                through what's possible for your specific ride.</p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>Do you travel to Whistler or Squamish?<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                    stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                  </svg></span></summary>
              <p>Regularly. The Sea-to-Sky corridor is part of our core service area, whether that's a ski day, a resort
                weekend, or an event up the highway.</p>
            </details>

          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cta-band">
        <div class="container">
          <p class="eyebrow center">Still Have Questions?</p>
          <h2>Just Ask Us Directly.</h2>
          <p class="lede center">A quick call is usually the fastest way to get a straight answer.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="tel:+16723773932" class="btn btn-primary">Call (672) 377-3932</a>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Contact Us</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <svg class="footer-skyline" viewBox="0 0 1440 400" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        aria-hidden="true" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMax slice">
